From 150234aa8257538a98fb2df55c2ddbf7696f5b7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 22:18:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Derive the Log Date from the system, not the operator
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Log Date is now system-derived at upload, in authority order: the
incidents' own machine-stamped CCIL timestamps (a ≥60% majority mapped
onto the 06:00→06:00 grid), then the document's hand-edited period
